{
  "name": "trayer-srg",
  "description": "trayer-srg is a lightweight GTK2-based system tray for UNIX, providing notification area functionality for window managers lacking native support. It implements the Freedesktop.org System Tray Protocol and EWMH specifications to handle icon docking, screen edges, and partial struts. The implementation features pseudo-transparency through root pixmap manipulation and multi-monitor awareness via GDK.",
